<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Nov tax revenue 7.5-8 pct over '95.</title>
<headline>Argentine Nov tax revenue 7.5-8 pct over '95.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's fiscal revenues were more than $3.8 billion in November, excluding income from private pension fund payments, a Finance Secretariat official said Monday.</p>
<p>The month's revenues were 7.5-8.0 percent more than the same month last year and 2.5-3.0 percent more than October's fiscal revenue, Gabriel Lopeteguy, a Finance Secretariat advisor told reporters.</p>
